Without prior written permission from the Copyright Owners, no individual, entity, or organization is permitted to:

1. **Copy or Redistribute:** Copy, download for redistribution, mirror, scrape, host, sublicense, publish, or redistribute the source code, curriculum, reference applications, or instructional assets, in whole or in part, through any digital or physical medium.
2. **Re-upload or Republish:** Re-upload, mirror, or republish the source code, reading platform, AdmitFlow reference platform, or curriculum files in another repository (on GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket, or any other hosting service), website, portal, learning management system (LMS), or online course platform.
3. **Claim Attribution or Ownership:** Claim the original source code, platform architecture, AdmitFlow application, instructional framework, or written content as their own, or remove, alter, or obscure any copyright, trademark, authorship, or ownership notices.
4. **Modify or Distribute Derivative Versions:** Modify, translate, adapt, alter, remix, or create derivative versions of this codebase, reader application, reference project, or curriculum for public distribution, sharing, or republication.
5. **Commercial Use:** Use the code, materials, templates, reference applications, frameworks, or curriculum for any commercial purpose, including but not limited to paid courses, commercial bootcamps, corporate training, client engagements, books, subscription services, or paid digital products.
6. **Reuse Substantial Portions:** Extract, port, or reuse substantial portions of the application logic, custom design system, interactive reader code, or AdmitFlow architecture in other software projects, products, or commercial platforms.
7. **AI Training & Dataset Extraction:** Ingest, scrape, or extract this curriculum, exercise solutions, reference application code, or documentation for training, fine-tuning, or evaluating commercial AI models or proprietary machine learning datasets without explicit prior authorization.

